---
date: 2025-06-09T00:00:00-04:00
---

Cagley is a town at the foot of Mount Cagley. For a time children went missing there and the town kept a curfew. The disappearances were the work of a shadow creature, the [[Terror of Cagley]], which laired at the bottom of an old mine under the mountain, down a hole with a ramp, past runes and the bodies of the children it had taken. Among the clothes strewn about the lair was a blouse tagged FF, for Fandra Fiddlesticks. A group of local children destroyed it, and the cavern has collapsed. The town is unhaunted now.

The creature will reform in thirty years.
